WEBVTT

00:00:01.857 --> 00:00:06.279
Two invented controller specifications are uploaded and indexed locally.

00:00:06.279 --> 00:00:08.842
The same requirement ID changes from 85 to 80 Celsius: a tighter maximum.

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:11.420
A human decision and reason are saved separately from generated answers.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:23.245
The finding opens a linked investigation; its review ID and result hash are retained.

00:00:23.245 --> 00:00:25.788
The actual local model compares both revisions and returns cited claims.

00:00:25.788 --> 00:00:29.788
Each citation exposes its exact quotation, source identity and original ranges.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:53.120
Further checks cover follow-ups, saved runs, abstention, document scope and cancellation.
